    id: "quest-earth-east-school-s-out-1",
    name: "School’s Out",
    description:
      "## School’s Out\nDescription: The Mayor won a lot of popular support when he insisted on sending his kids to public school to receive the same education as everyone else. Unfortunately, Orange Star High School’s security really isn’t up to snuff to handle a professional crew like the one that just took it over. The hostage takers are demanding a ransom for the mayor's children, or they're going to start executing the other students.\n\nPolice outside aren’t sure how to handle it and are willing to accept outside help, if you can prove to them you have experience in this sort of thing. How you use that permission is another matter. Either infiltrate the school, rescue the students, and bring the hostage takers down before anyone is killed or....exploit the standoff and make off with the ransom for yourself!\n\nRequirements: 2 Inventory Slots\nReward(s): Smoke Grenade // Flak Jacket // 200 Zenni\nTime: 2 Days // 700 wpd\n\nSmoke Grenade [200z]\nInventory Slots: 1\nDescription: A canister-type grenade filled with white phosphorous that when exploded will create a bright flash and a smokescreen. Makes for a clean getaway.\nEffect: USEx1. Use when your HP reaches 0 during a Quest Battle. You escape from Battle. Your HP is set to 1.\nFlak Jacket [1,000z]\nInventory Slots: 1\nDescription: A form of protected clothing that is designed to protect from shrapnel and low velocity projectives. Typically olive or camouflaged, the Flak Jacket is a typical form of light armor worn by soldiers. [UPPER BODY]\nEffect: +10% HP. When taking damage from a SUCCESSFUL energy attack, your opponent loses (5% Attack's Damage) HP.",
