    id: "quest-earth-east-the-apple-2",
    name: "The Apple",
    description:
      "## The Apple\nDescription: It turns out that the criminals at Orange Star High School weren't really bad guys. Well, not [b]that[/b] bad. Rumors have circulated that a strange golden apple was seen at the school before everything happened and that's not the only one. Rumor has it that there is going to be an invitation-only gathering where wealthy collectors and criminal brokers are preparing to auction the legendary Apple of Discord. Luckily for you, you have a reputation now.\n \nEither...\n\nThe police were impressed with your help during the school incident. They have an invitation and want to send you in undercover to get the apple!\n\nor....\n\nYour work at the school has impressed some important people. A mysterious invitation showed up with an apple on the front of it inviting you to the auction. Can you walk away with the apple, though?\nRequirements: Complete School's Out.\nTime: 2 Days // 600 WPD\nReward(s): 0.5x Base EXP Gain // 250 Zenni\nAlternate Reward(s): The Apple of Discord\nThe Apple of Discord [1,000z]\nInventory Slots: 1\nDescription: A golden apple found on Brutus. Legends have been passed on for ages about the wars caused by this apple. Toss it into a crowd and watch the action.\nEffect: USEx1. Choose a player on the same planet as you. They must challenge another player on the same planet as you this week.",
