    id: "quest-earth-east-the-constant-senzu-gardener-4",
    name: "The Constant Senzu Gardener",
    description:
      "## The Constant Senzu Gardener\nDescription: In the years since Korin was the only legend to grow the mystical and powerful Senzu, Earth farmers have discovered the secret to their harvest. However, conditions for growing senzu have become much more difficult and their overall effectiveness has dwindled down to a shadow of their former glory. It is for this reason most farmers have deterred from growing the mythical crop.\n\nOn the lower slopes of Mount Paozu lives Kohn, a balding and grumpy old man who can still be found practicing the time-honored tradition. Over the last few seasons, Kohn’s harvest has been in a steady decline and he suspects his leading competitor has a hand in it. Kohn needs you to catch him in the act and secure the future of his crops. Save the beans! . . . OR! . . .\n\nThere are only a handful of people still willing to slave over fields to grow the highly coveted Senzu, which means finding them for a good price is difficult. If you think selling Senzu is a cutthroat business, growing them can be downright dangerous when hungry dinosaurs and desperate competitors are involved. In the valleys below Mount Paozu, the competition has reached new heights and you’ve been recruited by one of the local farmers to see his opponents to an end. Well, maybe just their crops. Maybe.\nRequirements: PL: 700 // 1 Inventory Slot\nReward(s): Senzu Bean\nTime: 3 Days // 1,250 wpd",
