    id: "quest-earth-east-the-wrong-moon-17",
    name: "The Wrong Moon",
    description:
      "## The Wrong Moon\nDescription: Hikers traveling the abandoned roads between East City and Mount Paozu have begun reporting something strange. The moon disappears from the sky, everything goes dark, and several hours later they wake up somewhere else with no memory of what happened.\n\nNaturally, East City’s loudest anti-alien groups have decided this is proof that an invasion is coming. They’ve started stopping travelers, searching homes, and blaming every non-Human they can find. You know, normal East City community outreach.\n\nA strange silver fragment has embedded itself near one of the ruined roads and seems to be drawing anyone with an unusual ki signature toward it. Find out where the missing hikers are going, recover the fragment, and keep the locals from starting an alien invasion of their own.\nRequirements: None\nReward(s): Lunar Lens\nTime: 2 Days // 650 WPD\n\nLunar Lens [800z]\nInventory Slots: 0\nDescription: A curved piece of silver glass recovered from the East Sector forests. Looking through it reveals strange lights and signals that cannot be seen with the naked eye.\nEffect: Your Quests on Earth cost -50 WPD. If the Quest takes place in the East Sector, it costs -100 WPD instead.",
