    description:
      "## The old Red Ribbon Relay Station\nDescription: There is an old relay station in the Northern Mountains that was suddenly abandoned by Red Ribbon forces. It was used to summon Red Ribbon androids for unknown reasons, working like a silent alarm that draws any nearby machines back to the facility.\n\nSomeone has managed to turn it on again.\n\nAndroids have begun disappearing into the mountains, and whatever is calling them does not seem interested in letting them leave. Find the station, shut down the relay, and figure out why Dr. Gero needed so many androids gathered in one place. Hopefully the automated defenses do not mistake you for spare parts.\nReward: Wayfinder\nTime: 1 Day// 1000WPD",
