    id: "quest-earth-north-jingle-village-ice-festival-11",
    name: "Jingle Village Ice Festival",
    description:
      "## Jingle Village Ice Festival\n\nDescription: Jingle Village’s annual Ice Festival is only a day away and everything that can go wrong has. The supply sleds are missing, the ice sculptures are melting, and a storm is coming in fast.\n\nThe old Red Ribbon tower still has equipment capable of tracking the sleds and predicting the weather, assuming you can get it running without activating every weapon inside. Save the festival and help the villagers have one good day this winter. . . . OR . . .\n\nUse the tower to spy on the races, rig the contests, and place a few extremely informed bets. Nobody said saving the festival had to be charity.\n\nRequirements: None\nReward(s): Festival Champion’s Bell OR Thermal Signal Flare\nTime: 1 Day // 750 WPD\n\nFestival Champion’s Bell [500z]\nInventory Slots: 0\nDescription: A small silver bell awarded to the champion of Jingle Village’s Ice Festival. Whether you actually won anything depends on who is telling the story.\nEffect: USEx1. Your next Quest taking place in Jingle Village takes -1 Day, to a minimum of 1, and -100 WPD.\n\nThermal Signal Flare [500z]\nInventory Slots: 1\nDescription: A military-grade flare recovered from the old Red Ribbon tower. It burns hot enough to be seen through even the worst northern blizzard.\nEffect: USEx1. Use before making an Escape Roll during a Quest Battle. Your escape roll gains +8 to the combined result.",
