    id: "quest-earth-north-the-hunter-s-wager-12",
    name: "The Hunter’s Wager",
    description:
      "## The Hunter’s Wager\n\nDescription: A group of North City hunters has traveled into the Northern Mountains searching for a massive creature known as the Frostback. They claim it has survived avalanches, blizzards, and enough gunfire to kill a herd of dinosaurs.\n\nThe hunters have challenged you to track the beast, mark it, and return without killing it. It’s meant to be a test of skill and respect for one of the mountains’ greatest predators. . . . OR . . .\n\nA few wealthy collectors are offering much more money for the Frostback’s head. Forget the sporting rules, bring the right trophy back, and collect your real prize.\n\nRequirements: None\nReward(s): Frostback Trail Cloak OR Frostback Fang\nTime: 2 Days // 700 WPD\n\nFrostback Trail Cloak [900z]\nInventory Slots: 1\nDescription: A heavy cloak made from fur naturally shed by the legendary Frostback. It smells better than you would expect, though that is not saying much. [ACCESSORY]\nEffect: +10% HP. Your escape rolls gain +1 to the combined result.\n\nFrostback Fang [900z]\nInventory Slots: 1\nDescription: A massive fang taken from the Frostback. Hunters claim carrying it makes you more dangerous. The Frostback probably disagrees. [ACCESSORY]\nEffect: +5% Power. RESTRICTEDx1. Add +2 to the result of a physical Advanced Attack. You may declare this after rolling.",
