    id: "quest-earth-north-the-last-pilgrimage-14",
    name: "The Last Pilgrimage",
    description:
      "## The Last Pilgrimage\n\nDescription: The wandering sect of Yunzabit Heights is beginning what they call their final pilgrimage. Their oldest writings describe a sanctuary hidden beyond the fractured grasslands, built where the land was scarred by the hand of a god.\n\nYour actions at the first temple have earned you a place in the procession, whether the pilgrims see you as a protector, a destroyer, or the next god they should be worshiping. Guide them through the Heights, discover what happened to the pilgrims who came before them, and reach the sanctuary before the other interested parties following your trail.\n\nAt the end rests a relic still giving off the same terrible power found within the temple. Leave it with the sect, bury it where no one will find it, or prove that anything worth worshiping is worth stealing.\n\nRequirements: Destroying the Profane // Temple of Doom\nReward(s): Yunzabit Pilgrim’s Seal OR Godscar Fragment\nTime: 4 Days (3 RPs, 1 Battle) // 650 WPD\n\nYunzabit Pilgrim’s Seal [1,500z]\nInventory Slots: 0\nDescription: A stone seal carried by those who completed the sect’s final pilgrimage through Yunzabit Heights. The remaining pilgrims consider its bearer one of their own.\nEffect: Once per Saga, your next Quest taking place in Yunzabit Heights takes -1 Day, to a minimum of 1, and -200 WPD.\n\nGodscar Fragment [1,500z]\nInventory Slots: 1\nDescription: A fragment taken from the god-scarred sanctuary of Yunzabit Heights. The stone feels warm whenever destructive energy is nearby.\nEffect: Once per Saga, activate before entering a Battle while initiating or defending against [DESTROY POTENTIAL]. You begin the Battle Transformed and with +2 KI Points.",
