      text: "## One Shell of a Good Time\nDescription: On Kame Island, there is an elderly man who dresses up as the late Kamesennin Roshi and takes pictures with tourists, especially the lovely ladies. He has a request of you and if you can complete his task, he will bestow upon you a Turtle Shell much like the one worn by The Turtle Hermit. His requests may usually be perverse, illegal, or otherwise immoral . . . but he's not a bad guy, just too much like Roshi for his own good.\nRequirements: 1 Inventory Slot\nReward(s): Turtle Shell // 250 Zenni\nTime: 2 Days // 600 wpd",
