    name: "Yacht Club Etiquette",
    description:
      "## Yacht Club Etiquette\nDescription: You've earned a good vacation, and the cruise resort off South Paya sounds like just the thing. Filled with beautiful and wealthy vacationers, the resort offers a fine set of luxuries such as buffets, theater plays, golf course, virtual reality arcade, massage parlor, and other relaxing activities. However, this is your life, and that means things cannot be so easy. A scream wakes you up in the middle of the night.\nWhen you arrive on the scene, you learn that the ship's captain has been murdered! Luckily the guards on board are able to investigate the murder mystery and bring the criminal to justice. Unluckily, somehow their clues have wrongfully lead them to believe it was you! Prove your innocence by finding the real culprit, all the while evading the guards!\nRequirements: None\nReward(s): 100z // The next time you travel to another planet through space travel, it takes -2 Days to a minimum of 1.\nTime: 2 Days // 600 WPD",
