    id: "quest-earth-south-the-papaya-grand-final-15",
    name: "The Papaya Grand Final",
    description:
      "## The Papaya Grand Final\n\nDescription: The World Martial Arts Tournament has returned to Papaya Island! Fighters from all over Earth have come to test their strength, win fame, and hopefully avoid being knocked through three concrete walls before lunch.\n\nUnfortunately, someone has been sabotaging the tournament. Fighters are being attacked between rounds, equipment is failing, and ki blasts have started hitting the stands. Find the fighter responsible, protect the spectators, and make sure the Grand Final ends inside the ring. . . . OR . . .\n\nThe saboteur has offered you a healthy bribe to throw your next match and keep quiet. You could take the money, help eliminate another fighter, or frame one of the favorites before anyone figures out the tournament is fixed.\n\nRequirements: Must have completed at least one Quest in the South Sector\nReward(s): World Tournament Finalist’s Gi OR Fixed Match Ledger\nTime: 4 Days (3 RPs, 1 Battle) // 600 WPD\n\nWorld Tournament Finalist’s Gi [1,500z]\nInventory Slots: 1\nDescription: A customized martial arts uniform awarded to those who reached the World Tournament’s Grand Final—or saved everyone when the tournament fell apart. [FULL BODY]\nEffect: +5% Power. +5% HP. +5% Dexterity. Once per Saga, when entering a Battle as part of a Tournament Quest, you begin with +1 KI Point.\n\nFixed Match Ledger [1,500z]\nInventory Slots: 0\nDescription: A detailed record of fighters, bookmakers, bribes, and fixed matches. There are enough important names in here to keep South City’s criminal circles very cooperative.\nEffect: Once per Saga, your next Quest in the South Sector takes -200 WPD. Upon completing that Quest, gain an additional 200z.",
