    id: "quest-earth-west-the-flying-braggart-12",
    name: "The Flying Braggart",
    description:
      "## The Flying Braggart\nDescription: Wall-Mart is having a fire sale! The manager of the store is outside hocking all of their goods so the store can be bulldozed to the ground in order to build an even bigger Wall-Mart. In his hands is a brand new Herculian™Jet Pack but no one wants to buy it – even at these prices! He invites you to test it out and show everyone that, despite what several class-action lawsuits argued, they’re not the highly-flammable death trap the media has made them out to be.\nHe promises you that if you try it out and help him sell a few, you’ll get to keep it.\nRequirements: 1 Inventory Slot\nReward(s): The Herculian™Jet // 100z\nTime: 2 Days // 400 wpd\nHerculian™Jet Pack [800z]\nInventory Slots: 1\nDescription: A small white backpack-like device with shoulder straps and rockets on the ends that allows one person to fly comfortably. Or, if you’re in a pinch, two people to fly very uncomfortably. [ACCESSORY]\nEffect: Your Bukujutsu is considered 1 level higher for all effects and purposes.",
