    id: "quest-earth-west-so-far-13",
    name: "So Far",
    description:
      "## So Far\nDescription: A number of brainwashed Majins have started robbing markets all over, most recently cutting a swath through West City, leaving a trail of confused officers in their wake. Behind the events is a lone Wizard, pulling the strings like a puppet master. The police, nay -- all the citizens of West City need your help. Find their next target and stop them before they rob the planet blind. . . . OR . . .\nYou’ve seen the reports of Majins robbing banks left and right, hell some of them were banks you’ve robbed over the years. The reports have begun to pour in that a mixed-species gang of heroes has stepped in and is currently fighting the Majins. Tons of stolen goods, distracted idiot goo-men, and heroes too distracted to put up a good fight? According to your watch, it’s robbery o’clock.\nRequirements: None\nReward(s): Capsule Corp. Prototype Storage Capsule // 100z\nTime: 2 Days // 800 WPD\nCapsule Corp. Prototype Storage Capsule [1,250z]\nInventory Slots: 0\nDescription: These little devices have single-handedly help change the world. This new model is looking to improve on the design's function.\nEffect: +1 Inventory Slots. Items with Capsule Corp. in their title do not take up Inventory Slots. This effect does not work on spaceships.",
