    id: "quest-earth-west-knights-of-the-round-table-14",
    name: "Knights of the Round Table",
    description:
      "## Knights of the Round Table\nDescription: While Konos is regarded as the swordsman planet of the Universe, Earth has held its own with many organizations keeping the art of Swordsmanship active. One group in particular has been fine tuning the art of swordsmithing and dueling for over a millenia. This group, the Knights of the Round Table, holds tournaments every four years to grant entry for those worthy of joining their ranks.\nBy chance, you've gained entry into the tournament! The downside is, there are now over a dozen candidates that will be trying to stab you . . . legally. Win the tournament to gain a ceremonial blade and join the ranks of the Knights of the Round Table. Or just blow them off and take the prize.\nRequirements: None\nReward(s): Broadsword // Dual Sheath\nTime: 3 Days // 600 WPD",
