    id: "quest-earth-west-the-alpha-job-15",
    name: "The Alpha Job",
    description:
      "## The Alpha Job\nDescription: An anonymous tip has been submitted that somebody plans to infiltrate the Capsule Corporation mainframe. This attempt isn't a rare occurrence, but rumor has it that they hired professionals this time. As a heightened security measure, the Capsule Corporation has hired you to find these operatives and put a stop to them before it's too late. . . . OR . . .\nA mysterious man has contacted you and offered some risky employment: he wants you to break into the well-guarded Capsule Corporation and insert a disk that will run a specific program on the mainframe. You're not sure what this program will do, or whether it affects the data storage or life support or power supply systems, but you are sure that you don't give a damn because the pay is good: a rare piece of technology from the North Galaxy that will sell for a pretty penny.\nRequirements: None\nReward(s): Dragon Radar\nAlternate Reward(s): One Item from the West Sector marketplace worth 1,000z or less. (Players choose which reward)\nTime: 3 Days // 700 WPD",
