    id: "quest-earth-west-the-red-brick-below-23",
    name: "The Red Brick Below",
    description:
      "## The Red Brick Below\n\nDescription: Capsule Corporation has been surveying the ruined brick towers hidden in the forests outside West City. The towers were believed to be abandoned Red Ribbon outposts, but scans have revealed an entire facility buried beneath them.\n\nCapsule Corporation needs someone to enter the ruins, deal with the old security systems, and secure anything dangerous before scavengers find it. With android parts, unfinished weapons, and decades of Red Ribbon research down there, that could be a lot of dangerous things. . . . OR . . .\n\nSomeone has offered you good money for the facility’s location and anything Capsule Corporation finds inside. Sell them the survey data, steal something valuable before the researchers see it, or help the buyer take control of the facility themselves.\n\nRequirements: Scout Her // The Alpha Job\nReward(s): Red Ribbon Archive Key // One Technology Item from the West Sector Marketplace worth 1,000z or less\nAlternate Reward(s): Prototype Android Core\nTime: 4 Days // 700 WPD\n\nRed Ribbon Archive Key [1,500z]\nInventory Slots: 0\nDescription: A security key recovered from the buried Red Ribbon facility. Capsule Corporation has modified it to access several surviving Red Ribbon databases and sealed installations.\nEffect: Once per Saga, your next Quest involving Capsule Corporation, the Red Ribbon Army, or the ruined forest towers takes -1 Day, to a minimum of 1.\n\nPrototype Android Core [1,500z]\nInventory Slots: 1\nDescription: The unfinished central processor of an unknown Red Ribbon android model. It is useless by itself, but any sufficiently irresponsible engineer could build something around it.\nEffect: You may trade this Item to create a custom Technology Item worth 1,300z or less. The Item must be approved and balanced by an Administrator. This Item is consumed when used.",
    prerequisites: [
      {
        type: "source-text",
        text: "Scout Her // The Alpha Job",
      },
    ],
    requirementsText: "Scout Her // The Alpha Job",
    rewardsText: "",
    rewards: [],
    locationId: "location-earth-west",
    npcIds: [],
    encounterIds: [],
