    id: "quest-namek-foreign-languages-101-1",
    name: "Foreign Languages 101",
    description:
      "## Foreign Languages 101\r\nDescription: In order to utilize the Namekian Dragon Balls, one must know the ancient Namekian language. Normally, this would take years and a heretical teacher, but lucky for you the elder of Dahn-tu Village is offering to transfer his knowledge to you...for a price, of course. The healers of the village have been disappearing, and the elder wants you to find out why.\r\nMore importantly, he wants his people back! Find what’s causing these disappearances, rescue any Namekians on your way, and this just might be your big ticket to gathering the Dragon Balls.\r\nRequirements: Must not be Namekian\r\nReward(s): Ancient Namekian Language\r\nTime: 3 Days // 400 WPD",
