    id: "quest-namek-all-along-the-guard-tower-4",
    name: "All Along The Guard-tower",
    description:
      "## All Along The Guard-tower\r\nDescription: The body of one of Guru's guards has been discovered with no foreseeable clues as to whom killed him, or even if it was an accident. The Namekians have more pressing matters, but this is truly disconcerting.\r\nThe truth would put the citizenry to rest, but considering there are whispers that the Guard was holding onto something of importance that is no longer with his body, maybe there's something to be gained from all after all? If you return the guard's package then the people would be very grateful and reward you with their finest armor. However, the package could prove useful on its own...\r\nRequirements: None\nReward(s): Namekian Sturdy Uniform OR Unlocked Potential in a Can\r\nTime: 4 Days // 700 wpd\r\nUnlocked Potential in a Can [2,000z]\r\nItem Slots: 1\r\nDescription: The Guru's ability to unlock one's potential is well-known, but normally very restricted. For some reason or another, he had found the way to keep this power in a canister and had given it to the Guard. For what reason? Who knows? The canister is cracked and the mystic mojo has lost some of its oomph, but it's still there.\r\nEffect: 1.5x Base EXP Gain. Each character may only use this item once.",
