    id: "quest-namek-the-return-of-prince-piper-6",
    name: "The Return of Prince Piper",
    description:
      "## The Return of Prince Piper\r\nDescription: Ever heard of Prince Piper? Well, he was born with the name Pippen, but at some point that wasn't good enough for him and he changed his name to 'Prince Piper'. He terrorized Namek for about five days before he was captured, placed in a shuttle, and booted off the planet. He's back, and he really, really wants to be the next King Piccolo. Piper has been spitting out eggs filled with mutant Namekians and they've been terrorizing villages.\r\nJust, please, do something to get rid of them.\r\nRequirements: Must not have completed \"The Phoenix Must Not Rise\".\r\nReward(s): Snare's Horn\r\nTime: 2 Days (1 RP, 1 Battle) // 650 wpd\r\nBattle Info: Snare is a Mutated Namek that looks like a bipedal, short, green triceratops. For all Race purposes, he is a Namekian.\r\nSnare [Midorikatai]\r\nLevel: A\r\nRace: Namekian (Mutated)\r\nHP: 200\r\nPower: 100\r\nDexterity: 3\r\nMove Set: War Cry, Gut Punch, Torture Rack, One-Two Punch, Stranglehold\r\nSnare's Horn [400z]\r\nInventory Slots: 1\r\nDescription: A horn taken from the snout of a mutated Namekian named Snare. Some of Snare’s power still lies inside, and can be focused to grant extra ferocity. [ACCESSORY]\r\nEffect: RESTRICTEDx1. You may perform a Basic Attack or Basic Weapon Attack without taking up your turn.",
