    id: "quest-namek-the-return-of-prince-piper-7",
    name: "The Return of Prince Piper",
    description:
      "## The Return of Prince Piper\r\nDescription: Snare was the first, but not the last of Piper's creations. Another one is flapping its wings, dropping bombs on neighboring villages, some of which may or may not be fecal matter. That's just how Piper rolls. He's more annoying than truly a problem. Put this winged creature down, and then take out the head honcho!\r\nRequirements: Must have completed The Return of Prince Piper\r\nReward(s): 0.5x Base EXP Gain // Cello's Wings\r\nTime: 2 Days (1 RP, 1 Battle) // 650 wpd\r\nBattle Info: Cello is a Mutated Namek that looks like a bipedal, fat pterodactyl. For all Race purposes, he is a Namekian.\r\nCello [Aikakaru]\r\nLevel: B\r\nRace: Namekian [Giant Form 1d50]\r\nHP: 250\r\nPower: 120\r\nDexterity: 5\r\nRace: Namekian [Mutated]\r\nMoves: Bukujutsu, Impulsive, Machine Gun Kicks, Sniping Shot, Volcanic Smash, Dazzling Gymnastics\r\nCello's Wings [800z]\r\nInventory Slots: 1\r\nDescription: A large set of green pterodactyl wings that -- for whatever reason -- you have fitted with leather straps to allow you to move them and ... oh, really, you're using this for flight? Couldn't learn Bukujutsu? What's wrong with you? [ACCESSORY]\r\nEffect: Your Bukujutsu is considered 1 level higher for all effects and purposes.",
