    id: "quest-new-vegeta-super-soldiers-1",
    name: "Super Soldiers",
    description:
      "## Super Soldiers\r\nDescription: The Saiyan military is always looking to improve the physical fitness of their soldiers, however, unlike the Tuffles, they do not enjoy testing on their own people. It's not out of honor, but rather, they don't want to risk killing much needed soldiers in times of perpetual war. A new serum is to be tested and they are looking for healthy volunteers. Should everything go right, you should see some marked improvement in your physical performance.\r\nShould things go wrong .... they'll go very wrong.\r\nSolo Only\r\nRequirements: No SEVERed limbs\r\nReward(s): 2.0x Base EXP Gain // +1d10 Transformation Roll\r\nAlternate Reward(s): 0.5x Base EXP Gain // You die.\r\nTime: 1 Day // 800 wpd\r\nNote: At the end of your Quest, you must roll 1d10 in front of an Administrator. If your result is 4 or less, you get the Alternate Reward(s) instead.\r\nSavages\r\nThe Saiyans once lived in small tribes outside the Tuffle cities before they took over the planet. It's hard to believe in this day and age there are still Savage Saiyans roaming the outskirts, living in caves, refusing to be part of society. Congratulations, you just met a tribe of them, and they've knocked you out and taken you back to camp. For some reason, they are fascinated with you and after some tense introductions, they want to take you in as one of their own.\r\nRequirements: None\nReward(s): Savage Saiyan Pelt // Savage Saiyan Fur Boots\r\nTime: 2 Days // 650 wpd\r\nSavage Saiyan Pelt [800z]\r\nInventory Slots: 1\r\nDescription: A pelt made from an unknown, fur-covered animal native to Planet Vegeta. The pelts have been tailored and designed to be worn as a sleeveless top and a short 'dress'-like portion to cover the legs. [FULL BODY]\r\nEffect: +15% HP. Once per combat, you may perform an UNRESTRICTED Advanced Attack from your Style that you have not learned. You must pay the KI cost of that attack +1 to use this ability.\nSavage Saiyan Fur Boots [300z]\r\nInventory Slots: 1\r\nDescription: Fur boots made and worn by uncivilized Saiyans living in the outskirts of Planet Vegeta. [ACCESSORY]\r\nEffect: +5% HP. RESTRICTEDx1. You may perform a Basic Attack. This does not take up your turn.",
