    description:
      "## Supplies and Demands\r\nDescription: The recent war between Districts 3 and 4 have been devastating for both sides, especially the one that was nuked into the stone age. With District 4 reduced to a contained nuclear winter, the multitude of mercenary agencies from within are lost to the ages and the people of Shi’kir, as well as outside clients, have an even greater need for the fighters-for-hire that the planet is so well known for.\r\nRecruiting and training these squads will take time and effort, and securing clients is not a guarantee, but there’s opportunity to be had in the post-war Shi’kir. What are you, if not an opportunist?\r\nRequirements: None\nReward: The agency performs one non-saga quest on any non-Afterlife planet for you. You do not have to meet the requirements, as they will meet them for you. This may not be a quest you have already completed, or the counterpart to a quest you have already completed. You receive the reward for that quest and you are considered to have completed that quest for all effects and purposes. This quest has Days and WPD equal to the quest you choose.\r\nYou must fight any battles with your set, though you do not die and are restored to your normal HP after the battle.\r\nTime: X Days // X WPD",
