    name: "The Fallen God(s)",
    description:
      "## The Fallen God(s)\r\nDescription: The Kai are mighty creatures who are worshipped by many, and for good reason. They maintain the realm of the Universe, both the living and the dead. Well, turns out one Kai isn't so happy with the current rule of the land and has decided to come and make things right! The Shin-Jin has teamed up with a Makaioshin and are wreaking havoc across Taifuu. Think you can take down a god? Well, maybe you should get some help first.\r\nRequirements: 2 Person Joint Mandatory\r\nReward(s): 1.0 x base EXP // Small Storage Capsule\r\nTime: 4 Days (3 RP, 1 Battle) // 400 WPD\r\nBattle Info: Each participant will fight one of the opponents. If one of the participants losses, the other participant can fight them. They do not RECOVER before the second fight nor do they have to count it as a day. If both enemies are not defeated then the reward is not given out.\r\nMakaioshin [Kurokonwaku]\r\nLevel: Yours\r\nRace: Makaioshin [Your level, 1d80]\r\nHP: 30%\r\nPower: 30%\r\nDexterity: 40%\r\n[+] Move Set",
