    id: "quest-taifuu-the-azure-hurricane-17",
    name: "The Azure Hurricane",
    description:
      "## The Azure Hurricane\r\nDescription: The Penultimate challenge is upon you and it's not getting any easier. Margar is different from her predecessors in that she has two challenges. First, you have to find a way to beat her in a race! Don't worry, they encourage cheating. After that, maybe you will get to fight her. Hell, if you're unfortunate enough you might even get to do both challenges at once.\r\nRequirements: Going Down Under!\r\nReward(s): Ginyu Force Battle Armor\r\nTime: 3 Days (2 RP, 1 Battle) // 500 WPD\r\nBattle Notes: Marga is so fast that her opponents seem to move more slowly by comparison. Everyone fighting Marga has a -1 penalty to their Dexterity Bonus. She is wearing Ginyu Force Pants, Ginyu Force Battle Armor, Ginyu Force Boots, Ginyu Force Gloves, and a Ginyu Force Scouter.\nMarga [Akaikaru]\r\nLevel: F (28)\r\nRace: Taifuu [Typhoon Form 1d80]\r\nHP: 500 +5%= 525\r\nPower: 240 + 8%= 259\r\nDexterity: 10 + 13%= 11\r\nMove List: Blazing Speed Mastery, Special Fighting Pose 2, Swift Reaction, Speed Demon, Follow Up, Firestorm, Stampede Rush, Lord of the Flies, Blitzkrieg, Agile Medley, Chained Mauler, Backflip, Dazzling Gymnastics\r\nSpeed Level 2\r\nYour opponent’s escape rolls gain -3 to the results. Once per combat you may add ADVANTAGE to a non-restricted attack. You may not CRITICAL with that attack. Your quests cost -250 wpd.\r\nGinyu Force Battle Armor [1000z]\r\nInventory Slots: 1\r\nDescription: A set of rmored chestpiece with shoulder pads. It looks slightly different than most because they have the Ginyu Force Logo on it. This armor, along with the rest of the Ginyu Force outfit, show everyone that you are a part of the elite mercenary team known as The Ginyu Force [UPPER BODY].\r\nEffect: +8% Dexterity. +8% Power. RESTRICTEDx1. During your UPKEEP phase, Activate a Freestyle skill.",
